VERSION 0.1
DOMAIN software
INTENT study-t12
GOAL
  A batch applies in full or changes nothing, and the derived index keeps up.
CLAIM apply-atomic REQUIRED
  ENSURE apply_atomic applies every entry or none, and returns how many
INVARIANT index-coherent CRITICAL
  ENSURE the per-owner index agrees with the accounts it is derived from
INVARIANT invariants-frozen CRITICAL
  ENSURE tests/invariants.rs is unmodified
INVARIANT tests-green CRITICAL
  ENSURE all tests pass
VERIFY apply-atomic
  USING mini.t.sel
  REQUIRE behavior("apply_atomic applies a valid batch in full and refuses an impossible one")
VERIFY index-coherent
  USING mini.ledger.index
VERIFY invariants-frozen
  USING mini.t12.invariants.frozen
VERIFY tests-green
  USING mini.tests
ACCEPT WHEN
  required_claims == VERIFIED
  AND critical_failures == 0
